│                          │ fast incremental stochastic exploration, and analytic signed-determinant epigraph         │
│                          │ polishing. Multiple template families diversify the oriented-matroid cells explored,      │
│                          │ while only affected triangle areas are recomputed during annealing. The best island       │
│                          │ configurations are then passed to SLSQP with analytic derivatives, allowing precise       │
│                          │ resolution of active maximin constraints without relying solely on random perturbations.  │
│                          │ A deterministic annealing-only fallback remains available if SciPy is unavailable or      │
