│                          │ quality in two ways:                                                                      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. It uses adaptive low-tail merit weighting: broad low-area tails guide early            │
│                          │ exploration, while narrow tails focus late search on equalizing the true bottleneck       │
│                          │ constraints.                                                                              │
│                          │ 2. It applies a final signed-determinant epigraph SLSQP polish. Once annealing identifies │
│                          │ a stable orientation cell, triangle areas become smooth signed determinant constraints,   │
│                          │ allowing direct maximization of the minimum area.                                         │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The search remains deterministic, keeps all points inside the simplex throughout, and     │
│                          │ gracefully falls back to the annealed result when SciPy is unavailable or polishing       │
│                          │ fails.                                                                                    │
