│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The local polishing phase is improved substantially: coordinate maximin constraints are   │
│                          │ assembled analytically instead of repeatedly copying full point arrays, and the feasible  │
│                          │ LP polygon is sampled at centroid, vertices, and edge midpoints to retain useful slack    │
│                          │ rather than always selecting only its centroid. Several diverse elite basins are          │
│                          │ polished, improving the chance of reaching a stronger active-constraint arrangement while │
│                          │ remaining deterministic and avoiding external dependencies.                               │
